	(gr_text "1. Input at 10V p2p\n2. Set CV at 5V\n3. Trim SHAPE until \n   output at 10V p2p \n   (unity gain)\n4. Set CV at 1V\n5. Trim SLOPE until\n   output at 625mV\n6. Repeat from step 2\n7. Set CV at 6V\n8. Use TRIM to cap \n   gain slightly above\n   unity\n"
